OL,3,GNEWSAScotland's fire chief calls for
OL,4,Abetter wildfire planning to 'protect
OL,5,Alives'
OL,6,
OL,7,FScotland's chief fire officer has
OL,8,Fcalled for an improved, more formal
OL,9,Fapproach to wildfire prevention in
OL,10,Forder to "protect lives".
OL,12,FIt follows a number of blazes over the
OL,13,Fsummer, including a huge wildfire in
OL,14,Fthe Cairngorms National Park which
OL,15,Fburned for nearly five weeks.
OL,17,FThe blaze, which started in the
OL,18,FGlenmore area, near Aviemore, broke out
OL,19,Fon 15 July and burned across about 10
OL,20,Fsq miles (25 sq km) of moorland and
OL,21,Fforestry.
OL,23,APub: 24-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,426,420,260,160,0,100
