OL,2,W//%*// //%Q,.*,%-. * *,$%** %-& (,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSAScotland's fire chief calls for
OL,4,Abetter wildfire planning to 'protect
OL,5,Alives'
OL,6,
OL,7,FIn an open letter, chief officer Stuart
OL,8,FStevens said he had commissioned a
OL,9,Fformal debrief on the incident and
OL,10,Fcalled for government, public services,
OL,11,Fland managers, businesses and
OL,12,Fcommunities to work together to reduce
OL,13,Fthe growing threat of wildfires.
OL,23,APub: 24-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
